    "title": "Saints Rally from 21 Down to Shock GCCC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brock Kappelmann ,\n1 days ago The Seward County Saints rallied from 21 points down to shock the Garden City Broncbusters 92-90 Wednesday night at Conestoga Energy Arena. Antonio Williams Jr. poured in 33 points and Lucas N’Gombo added 25. Seward snaps a nine game losing streak against GCCC and beats the Busters for the first time since 2021. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
